From: Diogo Casteluber Laass <4793368+iowaz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:04:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] TrickyStore: Add scheduled keybox monitoring and validated
 recovery

Owner-requested opt-in keybox monitoring and recovery.
Intervals: 15/30/45 minutes and 1/4/12/24 hours.
Shared manual/background operations, configurable notifications and en-US/pt-BR.
Includes the reviewed follow-up fixes; source tree unchanged by consolidation.
---
 core/java/android/app/IActivityManager.aidl | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/java/android/app/IActivityManager.aidl b/core/java/android/app/IActivityManager.aidl
index 24c5cac21ad967b7966e96178fce5be87d7ef24d..42bfacbaf0e686c9a3ba43ecefcbe1ac53ee87fe 100644
--- a/core/java/android/app/IActivityManager.aidl
+++ b/core/java/android/app/IActivityManager.aidl
@@ -1122,4 +1122,8 @@ interface IActivityManager {
     void setDuckRkpEnabled(boolean enabled);
     void provisionDuckRkp();
     void setSpoofTrickyStoreKeyBox(String keybox);
+
+    // Appended to preserve the existing hidden Binder transaction numbers.
+    // Settings/system UID only; work and callbacks are asynchronous.
+    void requestTrickyStoreKeyboxOperation(int operation, String payload, in RemoteCallback callback);
 }
